  m_text: 'You prepare for your day the same you did yesterday, and the day before,
    and the day before that.

    Start the coffee maker, feed the cat, and then
    finally brush your teeth and get dressed.

    Undergarments first, followed
    by pants, shirt, then belt, and as you slid the last sock onto your foot

    you
    notice that the flower on your window sill has wilted. The White Lily sat to
    the right of the photo you had taken with your sister on her wedding day, and
    to the left of her Urn.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 938c08f24bff75d479690300d63b53c5, type: 2}
